# Recipe-local ignores.
# Root .gitignore already covers dump/, exp/, logs/, downloads/ and
# egs*/*/*/data*. The last one also matches this recipe's `dataset/`
# package, so re-include it.
!dataset/

# LibriCSS corpus cache: for_release.zip (~6.4 GB), the unpacked tree
# (~17 GB) and gdown logs (create_dataset.download_dir in the conf/*.yaml).
# The root .gitignore only covers `downloads/`, not this recipe's
# `download` (a directory, or a symlink to an existing corpus cache).
download
